**Rule:** the cache key argument (`project_id` in `fetch_with_cache`) must be the entity whose data is being cached. If the function filters by `accountid` (per-user), the cache key can still be `project_id` (per-project) — but only if you accept that a different account on the same project would share cache. For true per-account cache, the cache key must be `accountid`.

