## Related-skill minimalism (added 2026-09-02)

When user asks «что у нас в related_skills?», default to MINIMUM viable set. Don't list every conceivable helper.

**Decision rule:**
- Include a related_skill ONLY if it gets loaded by the agent in normal use of this skill.
- Do NOT include skills that are merely mentioned in references/.
- Do NOT include `fst-pmpractice` (base class — implicit).
- Do NOT include future/planned skills.

**Example for `fst-project-health`:**
```yaml
related_skills: [project-search, mcp-server-probing]  # 2 only
```
Not 6+ like "project-completeness-check, project-timing-control, ..." — those are separate reports, not parts of fst-project-health.

